Digital Support and Integrated Mental Healthcare
Digital mental health platforms, remote consultations, and medication-adherence tools can complement traditional clinical services. Integration with qualified healthcare professionals may help patients maintain contact with providers and receive follow-up support, subject to privacy requirements and appropriate clinical oversight.

